书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["这里的拘留是行政拘留，人要进拘留所，不是罚完就走。替人介绍、给人提供场地，罚得和自己嫖一样重，第七十九条那一档管的就是这个。在宾馆、KTV 上班的人替客人通风报信，同样按第八十七条拘留 10 到 15 日。刑法第三百六十条原来还有第二款「嫖宿幼女罪」，2015 年刑法修正案（九）把它删了。现在这种事直接按强奸罪从重处罚，见本节第 18 条（对方不满 14 岁就不能发生关系）。「上门保健」「按摩推拿」这类招牌不改变性质，按实际发生的事认定。染上性病和艾滋病的风险，见第 1 节第 30 条（性行为全程用安全套）和第 13 节第 38 条（72 小时内去拿阻断药）。娱乐场所本身要注意的见第 22 节。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/09-22"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"不卖自己的器官，也别帮人找供体：肾到手 2 万多，同一枚转手卖 20 万，钱要被没收还要按交易额罚 10 到 20 倍"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/09-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"汉化漫画、搬运影视剧、分享网盘资源和盗版电子书，不收钱也是侵权；挂广告、收会员费就可能判刑"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":